100 CLS:PRINTCHR$(23)
110 PRINT"HELLO, I AM A COMPUTER.  A COM- PUTER IS A PROGRAMABLE TRUTH    TABLE, THAT CAN PREFORM SIMPLE  ALGEBRIC PROBLEMS A GREAT SPEED.  iT IS NOT MAGIC, ANY MORE THANAN AIRPLANE IS MAGIC. IT FOLLOWSDIRECTIONS WITHOUT QUESTION,";
120 PRINT" UN-LESS IT IS UNABLE IT COMPLETE   THE TASK, IN WHICH CASE IT IS   PROGRAMED TO STOP AND TELL WHY."
130 A$=INKEY$:IFA$=""THEN130ELSE10
200 CLS:PRINTCHR$(23)
210 PRINT"THIS IS A SIMPLE PROGRAM":PRINT
220 PRINT"  260 PRINT 'TAKE PHYSICS'"
230 PRINT"  270 GOTO 260":PRINT:PRINT"NOW LET'S SEE WHAT HAPPENS"
